{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302410","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302410","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130241001:1":{"text":"군가 축제는 10년에 한 번 열립니다.","source_cn":"战歌节每十年一次。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x886775E43E83FA67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130241002:1":{"text":"오랜 역사를 자랑하는 부족은 바로 축제에 참가할 수 있지만, 신생 부족은 시련을 통과해야 하죠.","source_cn":"旧氏族可以直接参赛，但新氏族需要通过试炼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69BC1778B5B99266","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130241003:1":{"text":"마지막엔 석양의 신이 비추는 성스러운 곳, 군신의 봉우리에서 최후의 승자가 결정됩니다!","source_cn":"但最终还是在战神峰顶，在残阳神照耀的神圣之所决出胜者！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x083566ECD21A9091","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:员工亚丝":{"text":"직원 애스","source":"员工亚丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}